### GET ALL USERS
GET {{FrameSeen_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Create user
POST {{FrameSeen_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Levi",
  "email": "levi@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Update user
PUT {{FrameSeen_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Levi Updated",
  "email": "levi@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{FrameSeen_HostAddress}}/api/users/1